# The build context of infra/docker/*.Dockerfile is the repository root. Nothing goes in unless listed here (the
# first line drops everything), so private folders, fonts, colour profiles, artwork, the Desk, the experiments and
# every .env file stay out of every image layer.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/api/
!apps/engine-queue/
!apps/web/
!packages/contracts/
!packages/desk-text/
!infra/caddy/
!infra/backup/

# and, inside what is let in: no installed or built files, no settings, no secrets, no tests, no fonts or pictures
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.tsbuild
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/test
**/tests
**/coverage
**/Logos
**/*.ttf
**/*.otf
**/*.ttc
**/*.otc
**/*.woff
**/*.woff2
**/*.icc
**/*.icm
**/*.pdf
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.webp
**/.DS_Store
